message: "If you use this code, data or the derived rasters, please cite the associated manuscript and this repository."
title: "Temporal reconstruction and spatial transferability of remote sensing estimates of negative air ion concentrations in Guangzhou parks"
abstract: "Reproducibility package for a study that combines 5,998 daily negative air ion observations from 14 monitoring stations in Guangzhou with remote sensing predictors, compares machine learning models under random, cross-year and leave-one-station-out validation, and quantifies where spatial transfer fails. Contains monitoring records, Earth Engine exports, the modelling table, trained models, frozen validation outputs and aggregated raster summaries; the GeoTIFF layers are archived separately."
type: software
